WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.585
Early AED awareness.

00:00:01.585 --> 00:00:09.191
The supplied 2022 manual states that ILCOR supports early AED use for a child in cardiac arrest.

00:00:09.191 --> 00:00:19.412
It reports higher survival among children with shockable rhythms treated early than among children presenting with other rhythms.
